        "intro_text": "<p>At Creste, the answer to too much screen time was never less screen time. It was something<br/>better to do instead. Every DIY kit arrives with high-quality, kid-safe materials and step-by-step<br/>instructions, so whether you are four or forty, you finish something you are proud of. Over<br/>100,000 people across India have made something with us, from classrooms and corporate<br/>offices to city art festivals and Lucknow's biggest Christmas carnival. Our work has been<br/>covered by Femina, Outlook Business and leading Indian newspapers.</p>",
